 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A common and naturally occurring pyrimidine nucleobase in which the pyrimidine ring is substituted with two oxo groups at positions 2 and 4. Found in RNA, it base pairs with adenine and replaces thymine during DNA transcription.</bp:comment>
